%N A399260 Order of the general semilinear group GammaL_2(K), where K is the finite field with q = A246655(n) elements.
%C A399260 The general semilinear group of degree 2 over K, denoted GammaL_2(K) or GammaL(2,q), is the semidirect product of GL_2(K) and Aut(K).
%H A399260 Groupprops, <a href="https://groupprops.subwiki.org/wiki/Order_formulas_for_linear_groups">Order formulas for linear groups</a>.
%F A399260 For q = p^r, |GammaL(2,q)| = r*q*(q-1)*(q^2-1).
%o A399260 (PARI)
%o A399260 [(q+1)*q*(q-1)^2*isprimepower(q) | q <- [1..200], isprimepower(q)]
%Y A399260 Order of GL(2,q): A059238;
%Y A399260 PGammaL(2,q) and SigmaL(2,q): A352807;
%Y A399260 PSigmaL(2,q): A399261.
%K A399260 nonn,new
%O A399260 1,1
